WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 20=

01:39.740 --> 01:40.540
I want more!

01:41.050 --> 01:42.540
Just one more.

01:42.690 --> 01:44.260
- Is there more?
- Is there more?

01:44.740 --> 01:45.490
I want that one!

01:46.130 --> 01:46.690
I didn't realize

01:47.490 --> 01:48.540
you liked children so much.

01:48.690 --> 01:49.980
This is delicious!

01:50.900 --> 01:51.430
No more.

01:51.480 --> 01:52.230
Still hungry?

01:52.290 --> 01:53.020
Yes.

01:53.850 --> 01:54.620
I don't like children.

01:56.380 --> 01:56.820
Your Highness,

01:57.460 --> 01:58.380
but just now...

01:58.490 --> 01:58.980
Yan Shang!

01:59.210 --> 02:00.100
I don't like children!

02:00.460 --> 02:01.180
Do I make myself clear?

02:06.620 --> 02:07.020
I'm sorry.

02:08.130 --> 02:09.030
Here, have one.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.030
Let me try!

02:10.260 --> 02:10.950
Let me try!

02:11.000 --> 02:11.910
- Here.
- This one's mine!

02:12.060 --> 02:12.980
Try this one.

02:13.060 --> 02:13.610
I'm going back.

02:14.060 --> 02:15.130
Give me one.

02:15.780 --> 02:16.410
Look at this.

02:16.690 --> 02:17.500
I want more!

02:18.060 --> 02:19.500
I want another one.

02:19.690 --> 02:20.850
- Is there more?
- Is there more?

02:20.940 --> 02:21.730
Aren't you going back?

02:21.780 --> 02:22.500
I want this one.

02:22.690 --> 02:23.420
Don't grab it!

02:23.470 --> 02:25.840
- It's mine!
- I've only got one left!

02:26.340 --> 02:26.610
Right.

02:27.940 --> 02:29.220
Your Highness, go on without me.

02:29.850 --> 02:30.730
I still have things to do.

02:32.850 --> 02:33.380
Smells delicious!

02:33.500 --> 02:34.690
Here, give me one.

02:36.380 --> 02:37.130
Smells delicious!

02:37.540 --> 02:38.290
Smells delicious!

02:53.410 --> 02:54.780
Of course he'd mind.

03:01.260 --> 03:02.940
Who wouldn't?

03:08.570 --> 03:09.570
Even I...

03:34.010 --> 03:34.410
Your Highness!

03:37.340 --> 03:38.100
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
Did you just get here?

03:38.570 --> 03:39.690
I thought you'd be home by now.

03:40.980 --> 03:41.450
What's wrong?

03:42.380 --> 03:43.130
Where have you been?

03:46.380 --> 03:47.100
They're all gone.

03:47.850 --> 03:48.890
You didn't save one for yourself.

03:49.410 --> 03:50.570
So I went to buy more.

03:51.130 --> 03:52.170
The shops were already closed.

03:52.660 --> 03:53.610
I knocked for ages.

03:59.010 --> 03:59.450
Aren't you cold?

04:00.060 --> 04:00.340
Come on.

04:01.060 --> 04:01.570
Get inside.

04:15.100 --> 04:15.890
Why are you so clumsy?

04:16.140 --> 04:17.250
Didn't you play with these as a child?

04:17.850 --> 04:18.340
No.

04:19.020 --> 04:19.670
When I was little,

04:19.720 --> 04:21.480
I spent every day
studying and doing farm work.

04:22.140 --> 04:22.580
Unlike you,

04:23.460 --> 04:24.170
always so mischievous.

04:24.170 --> 04:27.820
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

04:29.120 --> 04:32.140
♪Be the sleeve we held♪

04:32.140 --> 04:32.490
Try it.

04:32.490 --> 04:35.720
♪Worn by dust and years♪

04:35.720 --> 04:37.250
♪Let's conspire♪

04:37.250 --> 04:37.700
Is it good?

04:37.700 --> 04:41.980
♪To grow old together♪

04:42.810 --> 04:43.140
Wipe your mouth.

04:44.260 --> 04:49.200
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

04:49.250 --> 04:49.730
You have some too.

04:49.900 --> 04:55.930
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

04:57.630 --> 05:00.614
♪Soar with the wind,
burning bright as a song♪

05:00.615 --> 05:02.480
♪Plunge into hellfire as one♪

05:02.700 --> 05:05.850
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

05:06.580 --> 05:11.210
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

05:11.790 --> 05:15.890
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

05:16.580 --> 05:18.430
♪Not a single hour less♪

05:18.480 --> 05:25.480
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

05:26.140 --> 05:29.320
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

05:29.680 --> 05:33.000
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

05:33.000 --> 05:34.460
♪If we can stay♪

05:34.460 --> 05:34.810
Your Highness.

05:36.580 --> 05:37.100
What's wrong?

05:37.810 --> 05:39.250
I loved reading as a child.

05:40.290 --> 05:40.700
And now,

05:41.460 --> 05:42.250
I still do.

05:43.220 --> 05:44.250
What you loved as a child,

05:45.050 --> 05:45.490
you can

05:46.410 --> 05:47.580
still love as an adult.

05:47.580 --> 05:50.460
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain♪

05:50.460 --> 05:51.220
That's different.

05:52.140 --> 05:53.050
These little things

05:53.610 --> 05:55.050
are meant to be gifts

05:55.290 --> 05:56.340
that bring you joy.

05:57.220 --> 05:58.290
If you have to buy for yourself

05:58.610 --> 05:59.490
everything you want,

06:00.220 --> 06:00.980
how sad is that?

06:01.490 --> 06:02.050
That won't happen to me.

06:07.490 --> 06:07.980
Then

06:08.700 --> 06:09.660
I'll buy them for you.

06:11.140 --> 06:12.900
Whether you're ten

06:13.460 --> 06:13.850
or

06:14.610 --> 06:15.610
twenty.

06:17.380 --> 06:22.320
♪Let me be the fireflies
dancing across your brow♪

06:25.610 --> 06:26.700
You spent next to nothing,

06:27.170 --> 06:28.100
and you're making me sad.

06:30.060 --> 06:33.466
♪Together we'll soar to the skies,
burning bright as a song♪

06:33.467 --> 06:35.170
♪Together we'll turn to ashes♪

06:35.220 --> 06:36.210
Your embroidered shoes are wet.

06:36.260 --> 06:38.240
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

06:38.240 --> 06:38.660
Your Highness,

06:40.580 --> 06:41.370
let me take you back to your room.

06:41.370 --> 06:45.010
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

06:45.010 --> 06:49.110
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

06:49.800 --> 06:51.650
♪Not a single hour less♪

06:51.700 --> 06:58.700
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

06:59.360 --> 07:02.540
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

07:02.900 --> 07:06.220
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

07:06.390 --> 07:12.990
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

07:13.720 --> 07:16.000
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

07:16.000 --> 07:18.030
♪- May time be free of pain;
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

07:18.080 --> 07:20.540
♪You're the only one I need♪

07:20.880 --> 07:27.870
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

07:28.020 --> 07:31.470
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

07:31.750 --> 07:34.490
♪My last untouched innocence♪

08:34.700 --> 08:35.420
May I?

08:36.820 --> 08:37.340
Your Highness.

08:38.850 --> 08:39.700
What did you call me?

08:48.220 --> 08:48.730
Wanyao.

09:22.940 --> 09:23.940
You're so clumsy.

09:24.300 --> 09:25.180
You can't do anything right.

09:25.370 --> 09:26.100
I have to teach you everything.

11:50.060 --> 11:50.490
Mr. Wang.

11:52.060 --> 11:52.340
Mr. Xu.

11:53.100 --> 11:54.220
What do you make

11:54.850 --> 11:55.770
of this passage?

11:58.490 --> 11:59.250
You mean

11:59.820 --> 12:00.250
this one?

12:05.340 --> 12:05.700
Mr. Xu,

12:07.010 --> 12:07.700
look at Mr. Yan.

12:08.650 --> 12:10.890
Early morning,
not seriously proofreading,

12:11.460 --> 12:12.490
his face is all flushed.

12:13.580 --> 12:14.220
What do you think

12:15.100 --> 12:16.300
he's thinking about?

12:16.700 --> 12:17.580
I suppose...

12:18.530 --> 12:19.910
Look at that glowing face,

12:19.960 --> 12:21.270
so full of youthful vigor.

12:23.460 --> 12:24.370
Without the Princess,

12:24.940 --> 12:25.820
could a nobody like him

12:26.650 --> 12:27.820
have come third?

12:29.460 --> 12:30.460
Everyone has their own fate.

13:14.220 --> 13:15.580
Congratulations, Mr. Liu.

13:17.700 --> 13:18.180
After you.

13:27.530 --> 13:28.180
Stop staring.

13:28.890 --> 13:30.460
You're not destined for promotion.

13:30.700 --> 13:31.180
Wenji.

13:40.730 --> 13:41.340
Rice cake!

13:42.180 --> 13:42.490
Try some.

13:49.060 --> 13:49.490
I never thought

13:49.820 --> 13:51.130
I'd get to eat rice cake in Sheng'an.

13:54.580 --> 13:56.100
You should make a wish with a rice cake,

13:56.610 --> 13:57.460
just like we used to.

13:59.890 --> 14:00.650
Just like we used to!

14:01.820 --> 14:02.130
I wish

14:02.700 --> 14:03.420
my parents good health

14:03.820 --> 14:04.490
and peace throughout the land.

14:04.770 --> 14:05.100
And...

14:07.700 --> 14:08.420
may you reach the highest rank!

14:13.130 --> 14:13.650
May you

14:14.420 --> 14:15.220
rise to the very top.

14:18.130 --> 14:19.460
Is it authentic rice cake?

14:19.820 --> 14:20.340
I haven't tried it yet.

14:21.530 --> 14:21.890
Try some for yourself.

14:33.770 --> 14:34.850
- Not quite authentic.
- Not quite authentic!

14:38.610 --> 14:39.530
I'll buy it from another shop next time.

14:51.100 --> 14:51.490
What's wrong?

15:06.650 --> 15:07.010
Yan Shang.

15:08.100 --> 15:10.130
I've been lucky to have you by my side

15:11.770 --> 15:12.650
after all I've been through.

15:17.700 --> 15:18.770
Back at the local school,

15:19.180 --> 15:20.220
how much did you help me?

15:20.940 --> 15:21.580
If I counted them all,

15:22.010 --> 15:22.890
I'd lose count.

15:25.130 --> 15:26.490
Just get to the point.

15:32.650 --> 15:32.940
Yan Shang.

15:34.250 --> 15:34.940
Actually...

15:37.220 --> 15:38.100
Yu Cheng'an talked to me.

15:54.180 --> 15:55.220
I nearly forgot all about you.

15:55.890 --> 15:57.340
You certainly know
how to keep your cool.

15:57.820 --> 15:58.980
Always so quiet.

16:00.460 --> 16:00.940
I...

16:02.300 --> 16:03.250
dared not disturb you.

16:06.060 --> 16:07.650
I heard you used to study.

16:08.180 --> 16:09.340
Why become a eunuch?

16:10.130 --> 16:10.420
In reply

16:11.010 --> 16:11.730
to Lord Yu,

16:12.340 --> 16:12.730
I...

16:13.250 --> 16:15.340
once hoped to become an official,

16:16.370 --> 16:17.340
but fate had other plans.

16:18.100 --> 16:19.370
I met with misfortune.

16:23.770 --> 16:27.100
Scholars have always
looked down on eunuchs.

16:27.530 --> 16:30.060
You must resent that.

16:33.820 --> 16:34.890
In reply to Lord Yu,

16:35.940 --> 16:36.530
I wouldn't dare.

16:40.300 --> 16:40.580
But...

16:42.610 --> 16:43.820
I do resent it.

16:49.610 --> 16:50.300
Tell me.

16:51.850 --> 16:52.770
Ten years of hard study,

16:54.580 --> 16:55.770
all to pass the exams

16:57.220 --> 16:58.530
and make a name for myself.

16:59.220 --> 16:59.650
But now,

17:01.530 --> 17:02.820
I failed.

17:08.700 --> 17:09.620
Then

17:10.900 --> 17:13.620
you should've stayed
in the Imperial Cuisine Service,

17:14.330 --> 17:15.460
enjoying free food.

17:16.010 --> 17:17.620
You'd have got by just fine.

17:18.250 --> 17:20.460
Why go to Hongwen Hall,

17:20.510 --> 17:22.720
a place with no perks?

17:28.180 --> 17:30.530
Seems your ambition to climb higher

17:34.420 --> 17:35.660
is still alive and well.

17:38.860 --> 17:40.010
I wouldn't dare deceive you, Lord Yu.

17:41.810 --> 17:43.050
What I mean is,

17:45.010 --> 17:45.900
as a eunuch,

17:46.900 --> 17:47.290
must I

17:48.050 --> 17:49.620
spend my life serving tea,

17:50.140 --> 17:51.180
forever at others' beck and call?

17:51.860 --> 17:53.050
I've read some books

17:53.900 --> 17:54.860
and know a fair bit,

17:55.810 --> 17:57.220
so why shouldn't I aim higher?

17:58.700 --> 17:59.420
And Hongwen Hall

18:00.620 --> 18:02.420
offers better prospects
than the Imperial Cuisine Service.

18:27.490 --> 18:27.980
Does he want

18:28.490 --> 18:29.010
to recruit you?

18:31.290 --> 18:31.570
No.

18:33.220 --> 18:33.730
Perhaps

18:35.140 --> 18:36.010
he just asked out of curiosity.

18:41.420 --> 18:41.700
Yan Shang,

18:43.810 --> 18:44.330
what do you think?

18:49.050 --> 18:49.660
Wenji,

18:51.050 --> 18:51.860
do you ever feel

18:52.660 --> 18:53.490
you could've done more?

19:01.220 --> 19:02.090
Princess Danyang

19:02.730 --> 19:03.770
helped me enter
the Imperial Cuisine Service.

19:04.770 --> 19:05.530
And with your help,

19:06.860 --> 19:07.980
I got a post at Hongwen Hall.

19:09.620 --> 19:10.490
That fulfilled

19:12.220 --> 19:13.180
my dream as a scholar.

19:16.330 --> 19:17.620
I couldn't ask for more.

19:18.810 --> 19:19.700
But now,

19:20.810 --> 19:22.140
I've been thrown into endless hell,

19:23.140 --> 19:24.250
left broken and ruined.

19:25.900 --> 19:26.660
Some things,

19:29.490 --> 19:30.900
I understand far better

19:31.660 --> 19:32.250
than I used to.

19:34.860 --> 19:36.530
So many people study for ten years,

19:37.570 --> 19:38.420
only to seek

19:38.980 --> 19:40.010
enough food and warmth.

19:41.700 --> 19:42.490
Those who become eunuchs

19:43.620 --> 19:45.220
seek nothing more than a steady income.

19:48.140 --> 19:49.730
Shouldn't we aim higher,

19:50.420 --> 19:52.220
all the way to the heart
of the Imperial Palace?

19:54.490 --> 19:55.220
Wenji,

19:55.980 --> 19:56.980
that's a dangerous path.

20:05.490 --> 20:06.090
Especially since

20:06.660 --> 20:08.220
Yu Cheng'an harmed Chunhua.

20:09.620 --> 20:10.380
Thanks for the warning.

20:12.770 --> 20:13.810
I haven't forgotten it.

20:16.730 --> 20:17.380
But Yan Shang,

20:18.460 --> 20:19.490
ever since you came to Sheng'an,

20:20.810 --> 20:21.810
entered the Princess's residence,

20:22.660 --> 20:23.660
and visited the Investigation Office,

20:24.730 --> 20:26.250
which path you've taken
hasn't been dangerous?

20:27.660 --> 20:29.330
I'm only looking for a way to rise.

20:30.220 --> 20:30.870
I'm not about

20:30.920 --> 20:32.310
to risk my life for Yu Cheng'an.

20:35.460 --> 20:36.290
But I'm worried about you.

20:45.660 --> 20:45.980
Thank you.

20:56.570 --> 20:57.140
Wenji.

20:59.010 --> 20:59.730
I should thank you

21:01.490 --> 21:02.860
for speaking so frankly with me.

21:10.010 --> 21:10.660
It's getting late.

21:12.090 --> 21:12.460
Yan Shang,

21:13.570 --> 21:14.380
let me see you out of the palace.

21:22.940 --> 21:24.330
Tell me what you really think.

21:25.090 --> 21:25.700
I wouldn't mind

21:26.420 --> 21:27.420
if you laughed at my sincere words.

21:30.010 --> 21:30.530
I think,

21:32.010 --> 21:33.010
in ancient times,

21:33.250 --> 21:35.090
there was the Grand Historian.

21:35.730 --> 21:36.290
And today,

21:37.980 --> 21:38.770
there's Lord Yu,

21:39.460 --> 21:40.530
head of the eunuchs

21:41.180 --> 21:43.620
and a pillar of the Huai Dynasty.

22:04.530 --> 22:05.250
With Lord Yu as my example,

22:05.810 --> 22:06.530
I believe

22:06.770 --> 22:07.900
whether eunuch or court official,

22:08.250 --> 22:09.860
what matters is
making a name in history.

22:10.620 --> 22:11.700
To rise through the ranks,

22:12.090 --> 22:13.420
the imperial exams aren't the only path.

22:14.180 --> 22:15.290
Can't a eunuch have

22:15.730 --> 22:16.620
a future of his own?

22:20.660 --> 22:21.290
Indeed.

22:22.220 --> 22:23.220
A fortune can't compare

22:23.860 --> 22:24.900
to the wisdom in books.

22:31.980 --> 22:34.660
If my foolish son could be like you,

22:35.770 --> 22:37.860
speaking such wisdom on the spot,

22:38.900 --> 22:40.090
I'd have nothing to worry about.

22:41.570 --> 22:42.220
You flatter me.

22:44.010 --> 22:44.730
Wenji.

22:46.940 --> 22:47.570
As for me,

22:48.490 --> 22:50.290
I've trained eunuchs before.

22:50.730 --> 22:52.290
They're loyal enough.

22:53.140 --> 22:53.900
However,

22:54.570 --> 22:56.900
they've read too little

22:57.980 --> 22:58.900
and lack the knowledge.

22:59.570 --> 23:00.420
They're not fit for great things.

23:02.660 --> 23:04.490
I'm willing to learn from you

23:05.420 --> 23:06.180
and I'll do my utmost

23:06.570 --> 23:07.620
to serve you faithfully!

23:13.730 --> 23:14.290
You may go.

23:20.900 --> 23:21.290
I will

23:23.380 --> 23:23.770
take my leave.

23:42.460 --> 23:43.530
(Since coming to Sheng'an,)

23:45.290 --> 23:46.290
(I've suffered
one setback after another,)

23:47.570 --> 23:49.050
(fallen into a bottomless abyss.)

23:51.420 --> 23:53.380
(At last, there's a glimmer of hope.)

23:56.050 --> 23:56.380
(Yan Shang,)

23:57.620 --> 23:59.220
(how could I let this chance slip away?)

24:01.220 --> 24:02.010
(You told me,)

24:03.220 --> 24:04.770
(even without hope,)

24:05.570 --> 24:07.330
(I must live for what I believe in.)

24:08.090 --> 24:09.900
(Taking down a petty man like Zhang Jun)

24:10.620 --> 24:13.350
(took the Princess
and the third-ranked scholar)

24:13.400 --> 24:14.350
(working so hard together.)

24:16.570 --> 24:17.530
(But my enemies)

24:19.050 --> 24:21.250
(are far more powerful than Zhang Jun.)

24:24.220 --> 24:25.010
(Power)

24:26.330 --> 24:28.380
(counts for nothing)

24:30.010 --> 24:31.330
(except)

24:32.700 --> 24:33.660
(before greater power.)

24:38.980 --> 24:39.900
(Within these palace walls,)

24:41.570 --> 24:43.770
(who knows if there's no path for me)

24:45.730 --> 24:47.140
(to reach the very top?)

24:58.860 --> 24:59.290
Your Highness,

24:59.700 --> 25:01.420
will you wear this pearl hairpin
again today?

25:02.220 --> 25:03.250
I'll do your hair now.

25:08.290 --> 25:08.700
Cailian.

25:09.570 --> 25:10.420
Pick any outfit of mine.

25:10.860 --> 25:12.220
I'm giving it to you.

25:13.290 --> 25:14.460
Lend me

25:14.770 --> 25:15.290
what you're wearing.

25:15.740 --> 25:16.980
(Cailian, Princess Danyang's Maid)

25:23.220 --> 25:24.420
(Hongwen Hall; Pursuit of Wisdom)
See you tomorrow, Mr. Wang.

25:24.660 --> 25:25.500
All right. See you tomorrow.

25:25.550 --> 25:26.030
Take care.

25:26.080 --> 25:26.450
I'm off.

25:27.810 --> 25:28.860
(Quiet Contemplation)
Remember to proofread this.

25:33.220 --> 25:33.730
Yan Shang,

25:34.220 --> 25:35.220
why aren't you heading home?

25:35.330 --> 25:36.620
Your maid is waiting outside.

25:37.570 --> 25:38.290
A maid?

25:38.770 --> 25:39.330
Mine?

25:39.570 --> 25:40.940
Yes, that's what she said.

25:41.050 --> 25:41.730
She's here to pick you up.

25:50.460 --> 25:50.940
Yan Shang,

25:51.730 --> 25:53.330
your maid is absolutely stunning.

26:01.010 --> 26:01.620
She certainly is.

26:02.180 --> 26:03.390
I couldn't find a woman like her

26:03.440 --> 26:04.550
in my household.

26:05.620 --> 26:06.090
Yan Shang,

26:06.620 --> 26:07.980
would you be willing

26:08.420 --> 26:08.860
to part with her?

26:11.140 --> 26:12.620
Yan Shang, you should let her go.

26:13.010 --> 26:15.530
If you're willing to give her to me,

26:16.050 --> 26:16.730
you can name

26:17.140 --> 26:18.090
your price.

26:19.620 --> 26:20.730
This is no joking matter.

26:26.180 --> 26:27.700
Your Highness, what brings you here?

26:36.940 --> 26:38.090
Is a maid just an object

26:38.810 --> 26:39.620
for you to take?

26:40.660 --> 26:42.140
You petty officials

26:42.490 --> 26:43.380
dare to ask for me?

26:44.530 --> 26:44.940
What,

26:45.940 --> 26:47.090
have you grown tired of your wives?

26:48.290 --> 26:49.420
Now you want to marry a princess?

26:50.380 --> 26:51.090
I failed to welcome you

26:51.460 --> 26:52.290
and kept you waiting, Your Highness.

26:53.140 --> 26:53.860
I deserve death.

26:55.220 --> 26:55.890
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

26:55.940 --> 26:56.730
Your Highness, please forgive me.

27:06.380 --> 27:07.140
Calm down.

27:07.290 --> 27:08.010
Dear Yan Shang,

27:08.530 --> 27:09.900
aren't you happy to see me here?

27:10.530 --> 27:11.860
Wanyao, stop fooling around.

27:16.090 --> 27:16.460
Your Highness,

27:17.090 --> 27:18.620
it's dangerous to travel incognito.

27:19.530 --> 27:20.420
Let's go back.

27:20.860 --> 27:21.700
Free time's rare.

27:21.810 --> 27:22.900
That's why I dressed this way.

27:24.980 --> 27:25.940
I'm so glad

27:26.290 --> 27:27.010
you came to get me.

27:28.660 --> 27:29.290
So where shall we go?

27:30.010 --> 27:30.940
During the Double Festival,

27:31.250 --> 27:32.620
the Emperor lifts the curfew.

27:33.290 --> 27:34.050
I want to see the night market.

27:35.420 --> 27:36.490
Your Highness, but...

27:37.730 --> 27:39.330
The Princess has an order.
Yan Shang, you must obey.

27:41.900 --> 27:42.220
All right.

27:43.330 --> 27:44.420
The Princess wishes
to visit the night market.

27:44.860 --> 27:46.050
Yan Shang of Hongwen Hall
will escort her.

27:46.420 --> 27:47.010
No disobedience.

27:48.140 --> 27:48.730
I obey.

27:49.490 --> 27:49.940
And one more thing,

27:50.570 --> 27:51.010
tonight,

27:51.330 --> 27:52.250
don't call me "Your Highness".

27:53.570 --> 27:54.490
I obey.

27:55.570 --> 27:55.860
Let's go.

27:59.940 --> 28:01.660
Look! The fire-breather is amazing!

28:01.730 --> 28:02.220
Look!

28:08.480 --> 28:10.200
(Leming Tavern)

28:13.220 --> 28:13.660
(Jinxiu Silk House)

28:19.250 --> 28:19.570
How is it?

28:21.380 --> 28:22.050
Too big.

28:24.420 --> 28:24.770
This one!

28:32.810 --> 28:33.570
You look better without it.

28:34.570 --> 28:35.180
Let's check the others.

28:41.050 --> 28:41.860
So pretty!

28:45.380 --> 28:46.050
No, thanks.

29:00.010 --> 29:00.660
Let's look over there.

29:15.810 --> 29:16.420
What's this?

29:18.620 --> 29:19.220
No idea.

29:19.900 --> 29:20.380
No idea?

29:21.420 --> 29:23.330
I'm from Lingnan.
Of course I don't know.

29:23.660 --> 29:25.220
Then how come you, a local, don't know?

29:26.460 --> 29:28.530
I seldom hang out. How would I know?

29:29.140 --> 29:30.010
You country bumpkin!

29:30.980 --> 29:31.620
You don't even know this?

29:32.290 --> 29:33.330
Seldom hang out, huh?

29:36.540 --> 29:37.340
(Rose Pastry)

29:40.570 --> 29:40.940
Wanyao!

29:41.530 --> 29:42.900
I checked it. It's called rose pastry.

29:46.860 --> 29:47.330
Pretty?

29:50.330 --> 29:51.810
My colleagues didn't flatter you.

29:52.460 --> 29:53.050
My lady

29:53.730 --> 29:54.620
really is breathtaking.

29:58.180 --> 29:58.900
(Pretty!)

30:00.010 --> 30:01.180
What a flatterer,

30:02.700 --> 30:03.530
dear Yan Shang.

30:05.770 --> 30:06.290
Bravo!

30:06.660 --> 30:07.090
Bravo!

30:07.460 --> 30:08.290
So pretty!

30:09.090 --> 30:09.660
Yeah.

30:26.980 --> 30:27.530
Missed.

30:28.180 --> 30:28.660
Excuse me.

30:29.620 --> 30:30.010
Excuse me.

30:31.490 --> 30:31.740
Thanks.

30:31.790 --> 30:32.160
What good luck!

30:32.210 --> 30:32.690
Excuse me.

30:34.660 --> 30:34.950
Sir...

30:35.000 --> 30:35.640
Let's have a go too.

30:36.180 --> 30:36.460
All right.

30:37.770 --> 30:38.220
Sir,

30:38.530 --> 30:39.700
what's the first prize?

30:40.380 --> 30:40.860
That one.

30:44.770 --> 30:45.660
That's beautiful.

30:46.180 --> 30:46.570
I want it.

30:47.250 --> 30:48.090
Win one for me.

30:48.250 --> 30:48.570
Me?

30:49.570 --> 30:49.900
I...

30:50.860 --> 30:52.140
I can't.

30:54.220 --> 30:54.620
All right.

30:57.700 --> 30:58.290
Here, sir.

30:59.810 --> 31:00.660
Sir, the arrows are over there.

31:03.530 --> 31:03.900
Try that one.

31:12.940 --> 31:13.770
So close!

31:14.050 --> 31:14.570
Try again.

31:20.490 --> 31:21.530
Almost!

31:21.900 --> 31:23.740
See? One more won't help.

31:23.790 --> 31:24.380
One more!

31:24.430 --> 31:24.950
Let me try again.

31:25.620 --> 31:26.140
He'll make it this time.

31:26.220 --> 31:26.980
No chance.

31:29.220 --> 31:29.770
Let me show you.

31:47.530 --> 31:47.860
Again.

32:12.090 --> 32:13.090
My lady is amazing!

32:13.380 --> 32:13.770
One more time.

32:33.180 --> 32:34.090
Just one left.

32:34.490 --> 32:35.010
Try it yourself.

32:35.980 --> 32:37.460
Win or lose,

32:38.180 --> 32:39.140
the prize is ours.

32:41.140 --> 32:41.460
All right.

33:03.330 --> 33:04.250
How did it fall?

33:05.940 --> 33:07.020
It was fine a moment ago.

33:07.070 --> 33:07.790
The flower fell off.

33:13.180 --> 33:13.490
Sir?

33:14.140 --> 33:15.700
Why get rough, sir?

33:21.540 --> 33:23.580
(Meng Zaishi, Military Governor
of the Central Circuit, North Jing)

33:39.460 --> 33:40.250
I don't want the prize.

33:41.250 --> 33:42.530
Give it to that lady.

33:43.810 --> 33:44.460
Yes, sir.

33:47.050 --> 33:47.420
No need.

33:48.770 --> 33:49.090
My lady,

33:49.530 --> 33:50.050
let's go home.

33:53.010 --> 33:53.730
Ladies and gentlemen...

33:54.090 --> 33:55.090
Your Highness, it's been a while.

34:01.140 --> 34:02.530
What do you want?

34:06.220 --> 34:08.130
So, you found yourself a new lover?

34:09.490 --> 34:09.940
Let's go.

34:10.340 --> 34:10.820
What's the hurry?

34:12.940 --> 34:14.260
Don't you want your things back?

34:28.690 --> 34:29.820
You've got the wrong person.

34:30.610 --> 34:31.460
This is my wife,

34:31.940 --> 34:32.820
not some princess.

34:33.420 --> 34:34.210
There's no curfew tonight.

34:34.860 --> 34:36.610
The Imperial Guards are everywhere.

34:37.010 --> 34:37.980
Please, show some restraint.

34:38.340 --> 34:39.380
Don't cause a scene with the officials

34:40.010 --> 34:40.980
and spoil the festivities.

34:46.130 --> 34:46.460
Dear,

34:47.260 --> 34:47.820
let's go home.

34:51.420 --> 34:51.820
Don't look back.

35:15.300 --> 35:15.690
Your Highness,

35:16.650 --> 35:17.050
are you all right?

35:18.610 --> 35:19.170
That man...

35:20.690 --> 35:21.340
He didn't follow us.

35:23.210 --> 35:24.130
Who was he?

35:24.980 --> 35:26.740
He didn't seem to be a local.

35:28.170 --> 35:29.090
As you said,

35:30.570 --> 35:31.490
he mistook me for someone else.

35:34.980 --> 35:35.380
Yan Shang,

35:36.300 --> 35:37.050
I'm a little tired.

35:38.130 --> 35:39.210
Take me back to the residence.

35:59.460 --> 36:00.490
You can go rest now.

36:00.860 --> 36:01.570
Everything's fine here.

36:03.010 --> 36:03.420
Got it.

36:28.610 --> 36:30.130
Mother, I hit it!

36:31.490 --> 36:31.980
Mother,

36:32.300 --> 36:34.050
(Young Mu Wanyao)
let's see who can shoot more accurately.

36:35.130 --> 36:37.860
The other day,
Yang Si challenged you to archery.

36:38.570 --> 36:39.820
Why didn't you accept?

36:41.170 --> 36:42.980
Mother, I don't want
to compete with him.

36:43.490 --> 36:44.380
He cheats all the time.

36:44.900 --> 36:45.420
Mother,

36:45.860 --> 36:48.210
everyone gets a prize for competing.

36:48.780 --> 36:49.530
If I win,

36:49.780 --> 36:51.420
you should give me one too.

36:52.300 --> 36:54.340
So, what do you want?

36:56.530 --> 36:57.490
If I win,

36:57.980 --> 36:59.340
I want a hairpin.

36:59.940 --> 37:00.780
All right.

37:15.760 --> 37:18.650
(Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors)

37:18.650 --> 37:19.130
Mother,

37:19.650 --> 37:20.740
where are we going?

37:21.170 --> 37:22.210
I don't know either.

37:23.820 --> 37:26.090
Mother, can we still go home?

37:26.490 --> 37:27.650
I don't want to leave Sheng'an.

37:28.780 --> 37:29.690
Of course we can.

37:30.460 --> 37:31.420
Once the rebels are defeated,

37:31.740 --> 37:32.690
we can go home.

37:46.740 --> 37:47.170
Your Majesty!

37:47.490 --> 37:49.170
Your Majesty, urgent news!

37:49.820 --> 37:51.570
Your Majesty, good news!

37:51.980 --> 37:52.460
Your Majesty!

37:52.980 --> 37:54.570
The rebels in Jiannan Circuit
have been defeated.

37:54.940 --> 37:57.570
Our forces captured
rebel leader Jia Xingzhang

37:58.050 --> 37:59.230
and executed him on the spot!

37:59.280 --> 38:00.000
Who led the troops?

38:00.490 --> 38:02.420
It was Yu Cheng'an!

38:02.490 --> 38:03.050
Good!

38:12.820 --> 38:14.570
Yu Cheng'an, senior palace attendant,

38:15.050 --> 38:16.490
rose to the occasion in a crisis...

38:18.080 --> 38:19.600
(Sheng'an)

38:31.740 --> 38:32.210
Mother.

38:33.490 --> 38:34.340
Apart from North Jing,

38:34.530 --> 38:36.130
are all the rebellions put down?

38:36.780 --> 38:37.260
Almost.

38:38.210 --> 38:39.610
We'll be back in Sheng'an soon.

38:41.580 --> 38:44.020
(Sheng'an)

38:56.610 --> 38:59.540
Meng Baiyu, Military Commander
of North Jing's Central Circuit,

38:59.590 --> 39:01.030
has shown great virtue and loyalty.

39:01.340 --> 39:02.650
We greatly commend him.

39:03.210 --> 39:05.260
Our eldest daughter, Princess Danyang,

39:05.610 --> 39:07.010
is gentle and virtuous,

39:07.490 --> 39:08.940
well-versed in propriety.

39:09.490 --> 39:10.300
We hereby decree

39:10.490 --> 39:11.820
that she be wed to Meng.

39:12.260 --> 39:13.490
Proclaim this far and wide.

39:13.980 --> 39:15.860
See that it is carried out.

39:17.780 --> 39:18.740
I beg you, Lord Yu.

39:21.340 --> 39:21.860
Your Highness

39:22.420 --> 39:23.650
has the support of the whole realm.

39:24.820 --> 39:27.430
Now war ravages the land,

39:27.480 --> 39:28.590
and the people are suffering.

39:29.490 --> 39:31.860
And Your Highness wants to stand aside?

39:32.740 --> 39:33.340
In times like these,

39:33.780 --> 39:35.130
how could that be acceptable?

40:00.860 --> 40:02.940
♪A daughter ventures forth♪

40:03.550 --> 40:05.990
♪In the name her father gave♪

40:06.950 --> 40:12.820
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

40:13.650 --> 40:14.210
What are you doing?

40:14.980 --> 40:20.380
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

40:21.410 --> 40:27.740
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

40:29.140 --> 40:31.120
(Mingde Gate)

40:31.120 --> 40:36.010
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

40:36.540 --> 40:42.180
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

40:44.600 --> 40:48.560
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

40:48.560 --> 40:51.000
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪
(Central Circuit; North Jing)

40:51.000 --> 40:52.940
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

40:52.940 --> 40:54.090
The soldiers are charging!

40:54.990 --> 40:58.060
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

42:08.490 --> 42:09.170
Let me go!

42:20.460 --> 42:21.340
Put me down!

42:22.090 --> 42:22.940
By Central Circuit custom,

42:23.420 --> 42:24.650
the bride is seized.

42:25.210 --> 42:26.170
Don't you know?

42:26.610 --> 42:27.490
I'm from Sheng'an!

42:29.260 --> 42:30.300
Not for much longer!

42:33.340 --> 42:33.940
Your Highness!

42:42.610 --> 42:43.340
My hairpin!

43:11.680 --> 43:15.920
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

43:49.980 --> 43:51.940
(So this is my husband-to-be?)

43:58.200 --> 44:00.600
(Meng Baiyu, Military Governor
of the Central Circuit, North Jing)

44:13.090 --> 44:15.300
You're not too pampered
to come after all.

44:15.650 --> 44:16.650
You are right.

44:18.530 --> 44:20.090
But married or not,

44:21.170 --> 44:22.050
wherever I go,

44:23.690 --> 44:24.940
I'm still a princess of Huai.

44:25.820 --> 44:26.940
Then today,

44:27.980 --> 44:29.860
it's time for the Princess of Huai

44:31.340 --> 44:32.740
to serve me in the bridal chamber.

44:37.980 --> 44:38.860
I'm from the Central Plains.

44:39.610 --> 44:40.380
By our custom,

44:40.820 --> 44:41.570
we haven't shared the wedding feast,

44:42.090 --> 44:42.650
drunk the nuptial wine,

44:43.380 --> 44:44.300
bowed to each other,

44:44.570 --> 44:45.170
or greeted our guests.

44:46.300 --> 44:47.300
How can we retire to the bridal chamber?

45:22.100 --> 45:26.500
(Next Episode Preview)

45:27.010 --> 45:28.900
We have to make it out alive.

45:31.170 --> 45:32.460
So is your father!

45:32.510 --> 45:34.280
And Yu Cheng'an's the biggest liar
of all!

45:35.490 --> 45:38.170
I'd never have spared
your worthless life!

45:43.320 --> 45:46.613
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:49.298 --> 45:54.214
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:56.408 --> 46:02.253
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:02.753 --> 46:07.979
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:10.748 --> 46:15.539
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:16.375 --> 46:22.454
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:24.255 --> 46:27.405
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:27.405 --> 46:29.053
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:29.105 --> 46:32.829
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:33.207 --> 46:37.873
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:38.492 --> 46:42.533
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:43.024 --> 46:45.139
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:45.179 --> 46:52.125
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:52.888 --> 46:56.341
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:56.521 --> 46:59.666
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:00.105 --> 47:06.742
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:07.139 --> 47:09.177
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:09.177 --> 47:11.653
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:11.691 --> 47:14.160
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:14.364 --> 47:21.251
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:21.563 --> 47:24.834
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:25.139 --> 47:28.312
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:28.636 --> 47:32.062
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:32.295 --> 47:35.520
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:35.851 --> 47:42.647
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:43.016 --> 47:45.078
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:45.079 --> 47:47.582
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:47.629 --> 47:49.967
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:50.198 --> 47:57.033
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:57.382 --> 47:59.000
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:59.130 --> 48:00.926
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:01.283 --> 48:04.300
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:04.340 --> 48:05.667
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
